### Order ID Validation Test

# Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:300pi
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Login to get token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
[object Object]
email":marco@italiandelight.com,
  ssword: Password123,
 businessSlug": italian-delight"
}

###1est Add Items with Invalid Order ID (should fail gracefully)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/null/items
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[object Object]items: [
    [object Object]
      itemId": 1
   quantity:1,
  notes:Test item
    }
  ]
}

###2est Add Items with Undefined Order ID (should fail gracefully)
POST [object Object]{baseUrl}}/orders/undefined/items
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[object Object]items: [
    [object Object]
      itemId": 1
   quantity:1,
  notes:Test item
    }
  ]
}

###3est Add Items with Invalid Number (should fail gracefully)
POST [object Object]{baseUrl}}/orders/abc/items
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[object Object]items: [
    [object Object]
      itemId": 1
   quantity:1,
  notes:Test item
    }
  ]
}

### 4. Test Status Update with Invalid Order ID (should fail gracefully)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/null/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[object Object]status": "CONFIRMED",
  "notes": "Test status update"
}

###5est Get Order with Invalid Order ID (should fail gracefully)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/null
Authorization: Bearer [object Object][object Object]authToken}}

### 6. Test Valid Order Operations (should work)
# First create an order
POST [object Object]{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[object Object]
  orderType": "DINE_IN",
 tableId": 1,
 items: [
    [object Object]
      itemId": 1
   quantity:1,
  notes": "Test order
    }
  ]
}

###7 Test Add Items to Valid Order (should work)
POST [object Object][object Object]baseUrl}}/orders/1/items
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[object Object]items: [
    [object Object]
      itemId": 2
   quantity:1,
      "notes": Additional item"
    }
  ]
} 